# Verification evidence stays out of source. These rules match dump directories,
# Xcode result bundles, and the default macOS screen-recording filename only.
# Product icons, brand SVGs, demo art, AppIcon.appiconset, and intentional
# example clips (examples/ai-contest/*/assets/demo-recording.gif) stay tracked.
# Keep other screenshots and recordings as test attachments or CI artifacts
# and cite them by name in docs/reports/. Prefer an evidence/ directory for local dumps.
evidence/
*.xcresult
Screen Recording *.mov
